invariant: INV-5
file: webpki_spki.c
catches: webpki_chain_test
reason: the modulus gate admits a 128-byte modulus, so an RSA-1024 leaf
  key passes webpki_read_spki and the walk copies it out as the key
  CertificateVerify will be checked under (docs/webpki.md, "Refused,
  and why": moduli below 2048 bits). The rsa_1024_leaf row, whose leaf
  must be refused with unsupported_certificate, objects.

--- old
#define MODULUS_MIN 256
--- new
#define MODULUS_MIN 128
